                          </a>
                      </h3>
          <p class="aalto-liftup-m-card__summary">The executive bodies of the university are the Board (AUFB), the President, and the University Academic Affairs Committee (AAC). The President&#039;s Management Team (PMT) coordinates the daily work at the university and the preparation of pre-decision motions. The Aalto Management Team (AMT) furthers transparency and open dialogue in decision-making regarding university development.</p>
